  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO SUPPORT THE AFRICA FOOD SYSTEM FORUM IN SCALING UP THE CONTINENT&#x2019;S EFFORTS TO BUILD HEALTHIER, MORE INCLUSIVE, SUSTAINABLE, RESILIENT FOOD SYSTEMS.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">If more robust financing is provided by Africa Food Systems Forum (AGRF) partners to implement the new strategic plan 2023-2027 in which the focus is a high quality and inclusive summit, year round activities with functional platforms, and a strengthened secretariat then the food systems will be transformed because there will be strengthened thematic platforms and financing platforms driven by a strong secretariat thus improving investment decision making and choice on policy agenda , deals and legacy programs generated by the forum</narrative>
  </description>
